-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wor}\\vdash\nR\\in\\{Q\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times X):\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(Q,X)\\}\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wor}\\vdash\nR\\in\\{Q\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times X):\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(Q,X)\\}\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>恢复已合并条目的历史引用目标；以固定载体上良序关系集合的成员记号表达原严格良序对象，不猜造未保留的历史谓词拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wellorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ 为 [[58-df-wellorder.md]] 的严格良序谓词，参数順序为关系、载体。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 采用 [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathc